{"declarations":[{"annotations":[],"doc":{"span":{"end_byte":365,"end_column":4,"end_line":9,"start_byte":27,"start_column":1,"start_line":3},"text":"A terminal color. Default is the color the surrounding widget would use\n(the base foreground or background of the text being drawn). Indexed is an\nxterm 256-color palette entry (0-15 are the ANSI colors: 0 black, 1 red,\n2 green, 3 yellow, 4 blue, 5 magenta, 6 cyan, 7 white, 8-15 their bright\nvariants). Rgb is a 24-bit color."},"generics":[],"kind":"enum","name":"real.toolong.model.TermColor","public":true,"source_order":0,"span":{"end_byte":456,"end_column":1,"end_line":15,"start_byte":366,"start_column":1,"start_line":10},"variants":[{"fields":[],"name":"Default","source_order":0,"span":{"end_byte":393,"end_column":12,"end_line":11,"start_byte":386,"start_column":5,"start_line":11},"symbol":"real.toolong.model.TermColor.Default"},{"fields":[{"default":null,"name":"index","source_order":0,"span":{"end_byte":415,"end_column":22,"end_line":12,"start_byte":406,"start_column":13,"start_line":12},"type":{"kind":"primitive","name":"u8"}}],"name":"Indexed","source_order":1,"span":{"end_byte":416,"end_column":23,"end_line":12,"start_byte":398,"start_column":5,"start_line":12},"symbol":"real.toolong.model.TermColor.Indexed"},{"fields":[{"default":null,"name":"red","source_order":0,"span":{"end_byte":432,"end_column":16,"end_line":13,"start_byte":425,"start_column":9,"start_line":13},"type":{"kind":"primitive","name":"u8"}},{"default":null,"name":"green","source_order":1,"span":{"end_byte":443,"end_column":27,"end_line":13,"start_byte":434,"start_column":18,"start_line":13},"type":{"kind":"primitive","name":"u8"}},{"default":null,"name":"blue","source_order":2,"span":{"end_byte":453,"end_column":37,"end_line":13,"start_byte":445,"start_column":29,"start_line":13},"type":{"kind":"primitive","name":"u8"}}],"name":"Rgb","source_order":2,"span":{"end_byte":454,"end_column":38,"end_line":13,"start_byte":421,"start_column":5,"start_line":13},"symbol":"real.toolong.model.TermColor.Rgb"}]},{"annotations":[],"doc":{"span":{"end_byte":1917,"end_column":4,"end_line":37,"start_byte":456,"start_column":1,"start_line":15},"text":"A style applied to the code points [start, end) of a StyledText. Offsets\ncount Unicode code points (Python str indexes), not bytes or cells.\n\nstyle is a style code: the canonical text form of one rich-style layer, kept\nas a single string so that densely highlighted lines stay far below the\n1024-node ABI traversal limit. It is the space-separated sequence of these\noptional tokens, in this order: \"fg:\" + COLOR (foreground set), \"bg:\" +\nCOLOR (background set), then for each attribute in the order bold, dim,\nitalic, underline, reverse either the attribute name (set true) or \"no\" +\nthe name (explicitly cleared, e.g. \"noitalic\"); an attribute not mentioned\nis not set by this layer and inherits from the layers below. The empty code\nsets nothing. COLOR is \"default\" for TermColor.Default, for TermColor.Indexed\n0-15 the prompt_toolkit ANSI name \"ansiblack\", \"ansired\", \"ansigreen\",\n\"ansiyellow\", \"ansiblue\", \"ansimagenta\", \"ansicyan\", \"ansigray\",\n\"ansibrightblack\", \"ansibrightred\", \"ansibrightgreen\", \"ansibrightyellow\",\n\"ansibrightblue\", \"ansibrightmagenta\", \"ansibrightcyan\", \"ansiwhite\" (in\nindex order), and otherwise \"#\" + the lowercase two-digit hex of red, green\nand blue: Rgb as given, Indexed 16-231 from the xterm 6x6x6 cube with\nchannel levels 0, 95, 135, 175, 215, 255 (index 16 + 36r + 6g + b) and\nIndexed 232-255 as gray 8 + 10 * (index - 232). Example: foreground\nIndexed(6), bold true, italic false is \"fg:ansicyan bold noitalic\"."},"generics":[],"kind":"struct","name":"real.toolong.model.StyledSpan","public":true,"source_order":1,"span":{"end_byte":2019,"end_column":1,"end_line":45,"start_byte":1918,"start_column":1,"start_line":38},"fields":[{"default":null,"name":"start","source_order":0,"span":{"end_byte":1951